{"id":"n38465-1-7","stage":1,"title":"기침 · 咳嗽","scene":"咳嗽与就医","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38465-1-7-1","ko":"약을 먹어도 기침이 계속 나네요.","zh":"就算吃了药，咳嗽还是没停啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"약을","meaning":"药","explanation":"약：药；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"약","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72379","senseId":"1","lemma":"약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"약을","audio":"/audio/f745a64b3ad605aada03.mp3"}},{"text":"먹어도","meaning":"服，吃","explanation":"먹다：服，吃；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"3","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹어도","audio":"/audio/c3703871d8ddc398461e.mp3"}},{"text":"기침이","meaning":"咳嗽","explanation":"기침：咳嗽；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기침","audio":"/audio/aa2351b107c957346a08.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38465","senseId":"1","lemma":"기침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기침이","audio":"/audio/c88ea8b3c12d44ff0138.mp3"}},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续。","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}},{"text":"나네요.","meaning":"发，闹","explanation":"나다：发，闹；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"20","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나네요","audio":"/audio/aa2149c3f9ff24584e7f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2a9db5dfd1480367","term":"약","zh":"药","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3","entryId":"72379","definition":"为了治疗、预防病患或伤口，服用、抹、注射的物质。","pronunciation":["약"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","z